<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#hasTime> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "Feature at risk - added in 2017 revision, and not yet widely used. "@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/2006/time#isPartOf
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#isPartOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
