<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Geometry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A coherent set of direct positions in space. The positions are held within a Spatial Reference System (SRS)."@en .
<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Geometry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Geometry can be used as a representation of the shape, extent or location of a Feature and may exist as a self-contained entity."@en .
<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Geometry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Geometry"@en .
# 
