<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#SpatialObject> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Subclasses of this class are expected to be used for instance data."@en .
<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#SpatialObject> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Spatial Object"@en .
