<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalAggregate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/w3c/sdw/gh-pages/time-aggregates/rdf/time-agg.ttl> .
